(7686106, 1258376, 67145, '<td valign="top">hmmmm ... looks like a road down under . !!! .. ;)<br/>its a brilliant image and i''m loving everything about it .. the fog takes it to another level .. hopefully you will do really well .. my vote will help .. :)</td>', 'hmmmm ... looks like a road down under . !!! .. ;)its a brilliant image and i''m loving everything about it .. the fog takes it to another level .. hopefully you will do really well .. my vote will help .. :)', '2021-02-05 01:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
