(7686208, 1258640, 36309, '<td valign="top">Amazing sky!</td>', 'Amazing sky!', '2021-02-06 13:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686237, 1258483, 149964, '<td valign="top">I really like this although found the exposure glare a little harsh.</td>', 'I really like this although found the exposure glare a little harsh.', '2021-02-07 05:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686367, 1258598, 124815, '<td valign="top">Terrifying and nice</td>', 'Terrifying and nice', '2021-02-08 12:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686368, 1258250, 124815, '<td valign="top">In spite of a too much used subject you managed to create interest.Save for a wee too much sharpening, this image is very fetching; the tonality, the lettering, the moment when you captured the water</td>', 'In spite of a too much used subject you managed to create interest.Save for a wee too much sharpening, this image is very fetching; the tonality, the lettering, the moment when you captured the water', '2021-02-08 12:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686437, 1258642, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice pastoral scene but that sun really makes the image for me.</td>', 'Nice pastoral scene but that sun really makes the image for me.', '2021-02-09 10:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686438, 1258246, 65234, '<td valign="top">This one makes me dizzy! Love the tilt to it.</td>', 'This one makes me dizzy! Love the tilt to it.', '2021-02-09 10:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686439, 1258551, 65234, '<td valign="top">Industrial loneliness. Perfectly centered perspective.</td>', 'Industrial loneliness. Perfectly centered perspective.', '2021-02-09 10:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686440, 1258331, 65234, '<td valign="top">Unusual subject for this kind of challenge but it works. Well spotted.</td>', 'Unusual subject for this kind of challenge but it works. Well spotted.', '2021-02-09 10:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686442, 1258376, 4008, '<td valign="top">I like it how the optical vanishing point is hidden in the fog.</td>', 'I like it how the optical vanishing point is hidden in the fog.', '2021-02-09 11:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686443, 1258632, 4008, '<td valign="top">A pity it is not fully symmetrical.</td>', 'A pity it is not fully symmetrical.', '2021-02-09 11:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686444, 1258656, 4008, '<td valign="top">A pity the pier itself is not prettier.</td>', 'A pity the pier itself is not prettier.', '2021-02-09 11:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686445, 1258491, 4008, '<td valign="top">A different perspective than most. I like it.</td>', 'A different perspective than most. I like it.', '2021-02-09 11:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686446, 1258308, 4008, '<td valign="top">Even with the lines and vanishing point, the eye is still drawn towards the man in the mirror.</td>', 'Even with the lines and vanishing point, the eye is still drawn towards the man in the mirror.', '2021-02-09 11:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686499, 1258257, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is the best representation of Vanishing point in this challenge in my opinion. Good shot!</td>', 'This is the best representation of Vanishing point in this challenge in my opinion. Good shot!', '2021-02-09 18:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686503, 1258257, 173844, '<td valign="top">This has the air of a fantasy film or book.  The surroundings are perfectly manicured, the trees are leaning outward, the path is long, there''s a golden city at the vanishing point.  The biker is poised at the outset of adventure, or maybe another chapter.  A single figure is not far in front.  The sun is shining, though muted, and the clouds are perfect.  The story is so captivating, please commence.  It''s a wonderful image that opens out, both visually and figuratively, into an entire new world.<br/>Personal co-favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'This has the air of a fantasy film or book.  The surroundings are perfectly manicured, the trees are leaning outward, the path is long, there''s a golden city at the vanishing point.  The biker is poised at the outset of adventure, or maybe another chapter.  A single figure is not far in front.  The sun is shining, though muted, and the clouds are perfect.  The story is so captivating, please commence.  It''s a wonderful image that opens out, both visually and figuratively, into an entire new world.Personal co-favorite of the challenge.', '2021-02-09 20:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686504, 1258257, 114285, '<td valign="top">What a bummer for the cyclist. I love those leading lines to the soft fluffy clouds, bumping up.</td>', 'What a bummer for the cyclist. I love those leading lines to the soft fluffy clouds, bumping up.', '2021-02-09 20:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686505, 1258632, 114285, '<td valign="top">Two photos of the Taj Mahal in this challenge, but I dont clearly see a vanishing point. I like the vintage filter this photo though.</td>', 'Two photos of the Taj Mahal in this challenge, but I dont clearly see a vanishing point. I like the vintage filter this photo though.', '2021-02-09 20:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686506, 1258259, 114285, '<td valign="top">Fits the  challenge well, bump.</td>', 'Fits the  challenge well, bump.', '2021-02-09 20:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686507, 1258551, 30214, '<td valign="top">beautiful abstract, love the coloring. My top pick</td>', 'beautiful abstract, love the coloring. My top pick', '2021-02-09 22:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686508, 1258598, 173844, '<td valign="top">What a breathtaking depth of field, turbulent clouds in the foreground and the line of a road far below, leading towards a distant panoply of mountains.  Makes for a dynamic composition and sensibility; we''re birds, sailing the updraft.  As the road is a line, it barely converges, but rather vanishes under the weather.  This seems entirely legit, unless you''re a stickler for points.  The tones of the land are delicately handled, difficult with such modest contrast.  The clouds are well-sculpted and intense, of a sort with which Beethoven could contend.  The overall blue cast brings all the elements into harmony.  Powerful and richly satisfying.<br/>Personal co-favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'What a breathtaking depth of field, turbulent clouds in the foreground and the line of a road far below, leading towards a distant panoply of mountains.  Makes for a dynamic composition and sensibility; we''re birds, sailing the updraft.  As the road is a line, it barely converges, but rather vanishes under the weather.  This seems entirely legit, unless you''re a stickler for points.  The tones of the land are delicately handled, difficult with such modest contrast.  The clouds are well-sculpted and intense, of a sort with which Beethoven could contend.  The overall blue cast brings all the elements into harmony.  Powerful and richly satisfying.Personal co-favorite of the challenge.', '2021-02-09 22:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686509, 1258259, 173844, '<td valign="top">Stylish image rich in unexpected detail.  Deceptively straightforward.  Has a sci-fi feel to it.  Pulses with latent energy and anticipation.  Muy bien, excelente.</td>', 'Stylish image rich in unexpected detail.  Deceptively straightforward.  Has a sci-fi feel to it.  Pulses with latent energy and anticipation.  Muy bien, excelente.', '2021-02-09 22:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686511, 1258476, 173844, '<td valign="top">Has a precise, mythic feel to it.  Maybe it''s the idea of travel, maybe it''s the fine detail that can be found in a diorama.  In any case, the moodiness of black and white conveys a timelessness that''s quite enjoyable.</td>', 'Has a precise, mythic feel to it.  Maybe it''s the idea of travel, maybe it''s the fine detail that can be found in a diorama.  In any case, the moodiness of black and white conveys a timelessness that''s quite enjoyable.', '2021-02-09 22:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686513, 1258613, 173844, '<td valign="top">Otherwise known as Poets'' Walk, in Central Park, NYC, though I like your name better.  Your scene is so peaceful, it must be early in the morning.  Usually it''s thronged with people and venders.  What I really love is your sepia toning, which magically takes one back a good hundred years, and more.  The overarching elms and delicate foliage are beautifully presented.  I''ve seen many pictures of this walk, but none as evocative and enchanting as this.</td>', 'Otherwise known as Poets'' Walk, in Central Park, NYC, though I like your name better.  Your scene is so peaceful, it must be early in the morning.  Usually it''s thronged with people and venders.  What I really love is your sepia toning, which magically takes one back a good hundred years, and more.  The overarching elms and delicate foliage are beautifully presented.  I''ve seen many pictures of this walk, but none as evocative and enchanting as this.', '2021-02-09 22:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686517, 1258257, 97225, '<td valign="top">Vanishing point indeed! Top 2</td>', 'Vanishing point indeed! Top 2', '2021-02-09 23:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686518, 1258329, 97225, '<td valign="top">Wow! They really do stretch on to vanishing point. Top 2.</td>', 'Wow! They really do stretch on to vanishing point. Top 2.', '2021-02-09 23:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686519, 1258533, 97225, '<td valign="top">An interesting twist. I''m looking forward to seeing who entered this.</td>', 'An interesting twist. I''m looking forward to seeing who entered this.', '2021-02-09 23:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686520, 1258640, 97225, '<td valign="top">To me, the figure blocking the view towards vanishing point disrupts the concept somewhat.</td>', 'To me, the figure blocking the view towards vanishing point disrupts the concept somewhat.', '2021-02-09 23:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686521, 1258631, 124815, '<td valign="top">Nice meandering<br/>Bump</td>', 'Nice meanderingBump', '2021-02-09 23:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
