(7686524, 1258308, 124815, '<td valign="top">I am wondering if flipping the image would not make more impact <br/>Bump</td>', 'I am wondering if flipping the image would not make more impact Bump', '2021-02-09 23:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686525, 1258491, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Great pov.</td>', 'Nice shot. Great pov.', '2021-02-09 23:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686526, 1258483, 173844, '<td valign="top">Somewhat like standing beneath a rocketship platform.  The vanishing point disappears in an explosion of light.  The perspective, of course, is key.  Myriad lines lead you throughout the image,  but you''re inevitably drawn to the stark central brightness.  The touches of color, red, blue, green and rust, provide a bit of relief from all the grey, varied and captivating in pattern as they are.  A strong, fascinating and captivating image.</td>', 'Somewhat like standing beneath a rocketship platform.  The vanishing point disappears in an explosion of light.  The perspective, of course, is key.  Myriad lines lead you throughout the image,  but you''re inevitably drawn to the stark central brightness.  The touches of color, red, blue, green and rust, provide a bit of relief from all the grey, varied and captivating in pattern as they are.  A strong, fascinating and captivating image.', '2021-02-09 23:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686527, 1258453, 173844, '<td valign="top">I''ll take your word that there''s a vanishing point ahead.  Sometimes the implication of such an eventuality is more provocative than its production.  Very cinematic, with an exciting blur to the figure.  The red secures the vitality and drama of the image.  Beautifully emotive.</td>', 'I''ll take your word that there''s a vanishing point ahead.  Sometimes the implication of such an eventuality is more provocative than its production.  Very cinematic, with an exciting blur to the figure.  The red secures the vitality and drama of the image.  Beautifully emotive.', '2021-02-09 23:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686528, 1258308, 173844, '<td valign="top">Rollover''s upon us.  Fine, fine image.  Didn''t know there existed a Legos bus driver and highway, to say nothing of the rain and fog.</td>', 'Rollover''s upon us.  Fine, fine image.  Didn''t know there existed a Legos bus driver and highway, to say nothing of the rain and fog.', '2021-02-09 23:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686531, 1258616, 30861, '<td valign="top">Awesome work, Jeb! I was one of the 9''s. The colors are beyond luscious. Congrats!</td>', 'Awesome work, Jeb! I was one of the 9''s. The colors are beyond luscious. Congrats!', '2021-02-10 00:10:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7686533, 1258257, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is positively surreal. It''s entrancing to study. I gave it a 9. Congrats!</td>', 'This is positively surreal. It''s entrancing to study. I gave it a 9. Congrats!', '2021-02-10 00:11:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7686534, 1258551, 30861, '<td valign="top">Love the color palette here. Congrats on your ribbon!</td>', 'Love the color palette here. Congrats on your ribbon!', '2021-02-10 00:12:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7686535, 1258647, 30861, '<td valign="top">I actually expected this to be the winner, it''s so perfectly framed. I was your 10 :-)</td>', 'I actually expected this to be the winner, it''s so perfectly framed. I was your 10 :-)', '2021-02-10 00:12:44.000000', NULL, 0),
