(7686547, 1258308, 100393, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by willem:</b></div><hr/><i> Even with the lines and vanishing point, the eye is still drawn towards the man in the mirror. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>And of course, that was entirely the intention of the image and why I shot with the lens wide open.</td>', 'Originally posted by willem: Even with the lines and vanishing point, the eye is still drawn towards the man in the mirror.   And of course, that was entirely the intention of the image and why I shot with the lens wide open.', '2021-02-10 02:05:34.000000', NULL, 0),
